<section class="view show">
 <section class="card">
  <div class="cardHead"><b>Branch transfer balances</b><span>Native currency · real posted journals</span></div>
  <div class="cardBody">
   <p class="tiny">These are independently booked interbranch dues, not available cash or final settlement. A branch collecting SSP and a branch paying USD have DIFFERENT currency obligations. Never add, net or compare those values without an approved interbranch FX reconciliation. Actual branch funding, provider confirmation and realized exchange profit are not implied by these figures.</p>
   <div class="tableWrap"><table>
    <thead><tr><th>Branch</th><th>Currency</th><th>Due from branches</th><th>Due to branches</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody><% if(!data.rows.length){ %><tr><td colspan="4">No posted cross-branch dues in this viewing scope.</td></tr><% } %>
    <% data.rows.forEach(row=>{ %><tr><td><%= row.branch %></td><td><%= row.currency %></td><td><%= row.receivable %></td><td><%= row.payable %></td></tr><% }) %></tbody>
   </table></div>
  </div>
 </section>
 <section class="card" style="margin-top:14px">
  <div class="cardHead"><b>Linked transfer reconciliation</b><span>Actual collection and payout currencies</span></div>
  <div class="cardBody">
   <p class="tiny">An approved rate locks the amount the receiver should get. Collection and payout remain separate recorded facts; a posted payout is not proof that interbranch positions were funded, that an external provider settled, or that Forex profit was realized. Investigate missing evidence before closing a financial day.</p>
   <% const linked=data.reconciliation||{items:[],hasMore:false,reviewCount:0}; %>
   <% if(linked.reviewCount){ %><p class="tiny"><strong><%= linked.reviewCount %> reconciliation inconsistencies</strong> in the displayed records require finance review. This is not a balance adjustment.</p><% } %>
   <div class="tableWrap"><table>
    <thead><tr><th>Transfer</th><th>Sender funds collected</th><th>Recipient funds due / paid</th><th>Internal stage</th><th>Reconciliation</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>
     <% if(!linked.items.length){ %><tr><td colspan="5">No linked cross-currency transfers in this authorized branch view.</td></tr><% } %>
     <% linked.items.forEach(item=>{ %>
     <tr>
      <td><a href="/tenant/money-transfer/<%= item.sourceId %>"><%= item.reference %></a></td>
      <td><%= item.collection %></td>
      <td><%= item.payout %></td>
      <td><%= item.stage %></td>
      <td><%= item.branchState %>
       <% if(item.issues.length){ %><div class="tiny"><strong>Review:</strong> <%= item.issues.join('; ') %></div><% } %>
      </td>
     </tr>
     <% }) %>
    </tbody>
   </table></div>
   <% if(linked.hasMore){ %><p class="tiny">Showing only the 50 newest linked transfers in this scope. This is not a complete reconciliation export. Narrow the operational history or use the audit reports for older records.</p><% } %>
  </div>
 </section>
 <section class="card" style="margin-top:14px">
  <div class="cardHead"><b>Unpaid transfers needing follow-up</b><span>Collected sender money · payout not posted</span></div>
  <div class="cardBody">
   <% const pending=data.recovery||{items:[],attentionCount:0,hasMore:false,attentionHours:24}; %>
   <p class="tiny">Only transfers with an actual recorded collection and no completed recipient payout appear here. A rejected payout review does not refund the sender or consume the original money. The <%= pending.attentionHours %>-hour marker is a review reminder, not an automatic cancellation or repayment authorization.</p>
   <% if(pending.attentionCount){ %>
    <p class="tiny"><strong><%= pending.attentionCount %> transfer(s) need follow-up</strong> among the listed unpaid collections. Confirm the real cashier balances and the recipient's status before taking action.</p>
   <% } %>
   <div class="tableWrap"><table>
    <thead><tr><th>Transfer</th><th>Collected from sender</th><th>Recipient owed</th><th>Outstanding</th><th>Next safe step</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>
     <% if(!pending.items.length){ %><tr><td colspan="5">No collected transfers awaiting recipient payout in this branch view.</td></tr><% } %>
     <% pending.items.forEach(item=>{ %>
      <tr>
       <td><a href="/tenant/money-transfer/<%= item.sourceId %>"><%= item.reference %></a></td>
       <td><%= item.senderCollected %></td>
       <td><%= item.recipientDue %></td>
       <td><%= item.hoursSinceCollection===null?'Collection time unavailable':item.hoursSinceCollection+' hour(s)' %>
        <% if(item.needsAttention){ %><div class="tiny"><strong>Review suggested</strong></div><% } %></td>
       <td><%= item.explanation %></td>
      </tr>
     <% }) %>
    </tbody>
   </table></div>
   <% if(pending.hasMore){ %><p class="tiny">More unpaid transfers exist outside the 50 displayed rows. This page is not an exhaustive compliance report.</p><% } %>
   <p class="tiny">There is no automatic refund button here: refunding a collected transfer requires verified outstanding liabilities, actual cash on hand, independent authorization, an auditable compensating transaction and confirmation that the recipient has not been paid.</p>
  </div>
 </section>
</section>